================================================================================
Twin-GaN  PCB copper loss / temperature analysis
================================================================================
Scenario : 54 V in, 20 A DC total, 10 A per channel, 25 C ambient, 10 min continuous
Stackup  : 1 oz (35 um) F.Cu/B.Cu, 0.5 oz (17.5 um) In1.Cu/In2.Cu
Copper   : F/B sheet R = 0.491 mOhm/sq, In1/In2 = 0.983 mOhm/sq, 0.3 mm via = 1.115 mOhm
Phase    : 9.43 A rms per leg (I_dc/(1.0607*m*cosphi), m=1, cosphi=1)

Thermal model: 106267 nodes, 271645 edges (Counter({'zone': 200131, 'vertical': 67900, 'via': 3300, 'track': 308, 'shunt': 6}))
  iteration 1: copper dissipation   3242.2 mW, Tmax   83.9 C, board avg  35.6 C
  iteration 2: copper dissipation   3513.5 mW, Tmax   89.9 C, board avg  36.5 C
  iteration 3: copper dissipation   3533.8 mW, Tmax   90.4 C, board avg  36.5 C

