SENSITIVITY: PHASE CURRENT (DC input held at 20 A total)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  A 10 A DC channel only forces 9.43 A rms/phase at FULL modulation.
  At part throttle the phase current rises as 1/m, so this is the
  optimistic end of the operating envelope.

   I_phase(A)  equiv m  phase copper(mW)  2.0mm trace T(C)
         9.43     1.00              1361              90.4 (solved)
        12.00     0.79              2403             140.4
        15.00     0.63              3754             205.3
        20.00     0.47              6675             345.6

  IPC-2152 (KiCad's own formula) on a 2.0 mm x 1 oz external trace says
     9.43 A -> dT =   91.7 K  (T =  116.7 C)
    12.00 A -> dT =  148.4 K  (T =  173.4 C)
    15.00 A -> dT =  231.9 K  (T =  256.9 C)
    20.00 A -> dT =  412.3 K  (T =  437.3 C)

